cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this action, please cite it as below."
title: "protocol-bench-action: enforce a benchmark claim in CI, by replay"
abstract: >-
  A GitHub Action that scores a Protocol-Bench submission on every push and fails the build if a
  claimed detection cannot be demonstrated. Every counterexample is replayed against the model it
  claims to break, so the gate cannot be passed by guessing.
authors:
  - family-names: Harris
    given-names: Nick
repository-code: "https://github.com/nickharris808/protocol-bench-action"
url: "https://nickharris808.github.io/verification-docs/"
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - github-actions
  - benchmark
  - model-checking
  - llm-evaluation
